 "name_en": "Sales of Non-Stock Item with Order-Specific Procurement (BDN)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Sales of Non-Stock Item with Order-Specific Procurement (BDN)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio4df91c6b4e3a44ccb0e46203e5a96e07\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4df91c6b4e3a44ccb0e46203e5a96e07__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables customers to order goods that may not be in stock. In this case, goods are procured from an external supplier. During sales order creation, a purchase requisition is generated and then converted into a purchase order for the supplier. Goods receipt is created for customer and special stock. After delivery and the creation of a customer invoice, the vendor invoice for the goods receipt can be created.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4df91c6b4e3a44ccb0e46203e5a96e07__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create sales order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Convert purchase requisitions to purchase order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve purchase orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods receipt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enter vendor invoice</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process outbound delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods issue</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing document</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4df91c6b4e3a44ccb0e46203e5a96e07__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer customer requirements directly to external suppliers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send goods from external suppliers to trader. The trader stays in charge for the entire delivery process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Fulfills customer requirements despite material shortage</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>含订单特定采购的非库存项目销售 (BDN)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio4df91c6b4e3a44ccb0e46203e5a96e07\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4df91c6b4e3a44ccb0e46203e5a96e07__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持客户订购可能没有库存的货物。在这种情况下，将从外部供应商处采购货物。在销售订单创建期间，会生成采购申请，然后将其转换为供应商的采购订单。为客户和特殊库存创建收货。交货和创建客户发票后，可以创建收货的供应商发票。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4df91c6b4e3a44ccb0e46203e5a96e07__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将采购申请转换为采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">输入供应商发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理出库交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账发货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建开票凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4df91c6b4e3a44ccb0e46203e5a96e07__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将客户需求直接传输给外部供应商</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将货物从外部供应商发送给交易员。经销商负责整个交货流程。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在物料短缺的情况下仍可满足客户需求</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
